#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:82
msgid ""
"Each start time is represented as ``k * II + r``. Directed dependencies "
"constrain absolute start times, while resource and owner exclusions choose a "
"non-overlapping modulo order. The solver finds the minimum feasible II by "
"binary search."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:87
msgid "Maximum number of physical versions available to automatic buffers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:96
msgid ""
"Directed ``(i, j, distance, latency)`` constraints. Negative distances "
"encode automatic buffer-version variables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:101
msgid ""
"Undirected shared-storage owner conflicts ``(i, j, latency_i_j, "
"latency_j_i)``. The chosen modulo order also constrains the reverse "
"wraparound hand-off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:105
msgid "Source-ordered task pairs sharing a hardware pipe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/transform/z3_scheduler/index.rst:107
msgid "Bytes occupied by one version of each automatic buffer."
msgstr ""

